## 3. Industry-Specific Risk
**Part A — Why This Company Can Compound:**  
issuing customers → attract premium cardholders → increase spending per customer → drive higher FCF and reinvest in marketing/network expansion → strengthen issuing relationships.  

This virtuous cycle is durable, as AXP’s network effects and pricing power allow it to capture a disproportionate share of high-margin credit services.  

**Durability Verdict:** **High** — AXP’s structural advantages are self-reinforcing and difficult for competitors to replicate.  

